<title>USA: TABLE-Ross Stores June same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Ross Stores June same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK, Calif. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		 $186	 $159     +17.0	 +9.0</p>
<p>Five-month</p>
<p>    period	   789	 $659     +20.0	+11.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   five weeks ended	  July 5.</p>
<p>Full company name is Ross Stores Inc.</p>
<p>NOTE: The company's same-store sales increased 9 percent in June of 1996 and 12 percent for the five month period a year ago.</p>
</text>
